# GIFManager Next — ignore rules
# GIFManager Next——忽略规则

# Byte-compiled / 字节码
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Distribution and packaging / 分发与打包
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
packaging/build/
packaging/dist/

# Virtual environments / 虚拟环境
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Editors and IDEs / 编辑器与 IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Test output / 测试输出
tests/output/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/

# NOTA BENE: the DATA directory, the log directory and the settings file are
# deliberately NOT listed here. They live in the per-user application data
# directory (see `core.paths`), not in the tree, so a stray `data/` in a working
# copy is a bug report worth seeing rather than something to hide.
# 注意：数据目录、日志目录与设置文件"刻意"不列在此处。它们位于按用户的应用数据目录
#（见 `core.paths`）而非源码树中，因此工作副本里出现零散的 `data/` 是值得一看的
# 缺陷线索，而不是应该藏起来的东西。

# A local data directory IS ignored, because `GIFMANAGER_DATA_DIR` can point one
# here deliberately for a portable run.
# 本地的数据目录"会"被忽略，因为 `GIFMANAGER_DATA_DIR` 可以为便携运行刻意指向此处。
/data/

# Optional bundled binaries: large, licensed separately, and platform specific.
# 可选的内置二进制：体积大、许可独立且与平台相关。
resources/ffmpeg/
resources/*.exe
resources/libgifdec.so
resources/libgifdec.dylib
resources/gifdec.dll

# Cargo's build cache / Cargo 构建缓存
#
# The native pipeline is an OPTIONAL build artefact, so its `target` directory is
# machine-generated intermediate output — hundreds of megabytes of it, including
# the compiled dependencies. The `.dll`/`.dylib`/`.so` a build produces is found at
# run time from `native/target/release`, so nothing here needs committing; a
# release copies the library into `resources/`, which the rules above already
# ignore for the platform-specific C decoder and would ignore for the Rust one too
# once it is copied there.
# 原生管线是"可选"的构建产物，因此其 `target` 目录是机器生成的中间输出——数百 MB，
# 其中含已编译的依赖。构建产出的 `.dll`/`.dylib`/`.so` 在运行时从
# `native/target/release` 找到，因此这里没有任何东西需要提交；发布时会把库复制进
# `resources/`，上面针对平台相关 C 解码器的规则已经忽略它，Rust 的那个一旦被复制过去
# 同样会被忽略。
native/target/

# OS noise / 系统噪音
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# The Linux/macOS virtual environment, kept alongside the Windows one when a
# checkout is shared between operating systems on the same NTFS volume.
# 与 Windows 那份并存的 Linux/macOS 虚拟环境，用于同一 NTFS 卷被多个操作系统共享的检出。
.venv-*/

# CI build logs dropped here for inspection / 放进来查看的 CI 构建日志
gitwork/
